# Tower defence: the whole first level at double speed, the keyboard cursor building and raising towers as the
# gold comes in (E and Q move between pads, Enter opens the wheel, 1 archer, 2 cannon, 3 frost; on a tower 1 raises
# it, Backspace closes): a level built without upgrades falls, this one holds the eight waves (the last one at
# night); the level is marked done with its stars and the victory scene counts the stats up.
scene: ../../../samples/tower_defence/scenes/level_01.owl
steps:
  - frames: 2
  - input: {key: Enter, frames: 2}
  - frames: 1
  - frames: 30
  - input: {key: F, frames: 2}
